%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 612
%%Title: Ten Boats Home, page 2: waiting for one most of all
/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 102 def } ifelse  Seed srand
(lib/cb_book.ps) run
cb-ground
/gold cb-light
260 cb-harbour-sky
-9 650 90 120 cb-pier
40 90 230 cb-lamppost false cb-hook-lamp
-120 90 330 cb-mama
/cb-face 1 def 250 90 210 cb-ana
% the memory: Grandpa's little blue boat, with its lamp
470 330 80 cb-inset
gsave newpath 470 330 78 0 360 arc clip
  newpath 380 240 180 90 cb-rect [0.36 0.55 0.72] 0.6 cb-wash
  newpath 380 330 180 90 cb-rect [1.0 0.86 0.6] 0.5 cb-wash
  /cb-boatlight true def /cb-face -1 def 470 300 34 cb-gpboat /cb-face 1 def /cb-boatlight false def
grestore
newpath 470 330 80 0 360 arc closepath 1.6 cb-line
cb-ink cb-rgb
(She waits for one most of all. It is little, and it is blue, and it carries a lamp just like the old lamp on the pier. It is Grandpa's.) 56 584 500 /center cb-text pop
2 cb-folio
showpage
